sequenceDiagram
    actor Customer
    participant LoanAppSystem as Loan Application System
    participant DocVerSystem as Document Verification System
    actor BankEmployee as Bank Employee
    participant LoanDB as Loan Database

    Customer->>+LoanAppSystem: 1. Register / Login
    LoanAppSystem->>+LoanDB: Validate Credentials
    LoanDB-->>-LoanAppSystem: Authentication Result
    LoanAppSystem-->>-Customer: Login Success / Failure

    Customer->>+LoanAppSystem: 2. Select Loan Category
    LoanAppSystem->>+LoanDB: Fetch Categories
    LoanDB-->>-LoanAppSystem: Category List
    LoanAppSystem-->>-Customer: Display Categories

    Customer->>+LoanAppSystem: 3. Submit Loan Application
    LoanAppSystem->>+LoanDB: Store Application
    LoanDB-->>-LoanAppSystem: Application ID Generated
    LoanAppSystem-->>-Customer: Application ID Confirmation

    loop Document Upload and Verification
        Customer->>+LoanAppSystem: 4. Upload Documents
        LoanAppSystem->>+DocVerSystem: Forward Documents
        DocVerSystem->>+BankEmployee: Notify for Verification
        BankEmployee->>DocVerSystem: Verify Documents
        DocVerSystem-->>-LoanAppSystem: Verification Result
        LoanAppSystem-->>-Customer: Verification Status

        alt Documents Invalid
            LoanAppSystem-->>Customer: Request Re-upload
        end
    end

    BankEmployee->>+LoanAppSystem: 5. Assess Eligibility
    LoanAppSystem->>+LoanDB: Fetch Customer and Application Data
    LoanDB-->>-LoanAppSystem: Customer and Application Details
    LoanAppSystem-->>-BankEmployee: Eligibility Report

    alt Loan Approved
        BankEmployee->>+LoanAppSystem: 6a. Approve Loan
        LoanAppSystem->>+LoanDB: Update Status to Approved
        LoanDB-->>-LoanAppSystem: Status Updated
        LoanAppSystem->>LoanAppSystem: Calculate EMI Schedule
        LoanAppSystem->>+LoanDB: Store Loan and EMI Details
        LoanDB-->>-LoanAppSystem: Loan Record Created
        LoanAppSystem-->>-Customer: Approval Notification with EMI Schedule
    else Loan Rejected
        BankEmployee->>+LoanAppSystem: 6b. Reject Loan
        LoanAppSystem->>+LoanDB: Update Status to Rejected
        LoanDB-->>-LoanAppSystem: Status Updated
        LoanAppSystem-->>-Customer: Rejection Notification with Reason
    end

    loop Monthly Repayment
        Customer->>+LoanAppSystem: 7. Make EMI Payment
        LoanAppSystem->>+LoanDB: Record Payment
        LoanDB-->>-LoanAppSystem: Payment Confirmed
        LoanAppSystem-->>-Customer: Payment Receipt
    end
